.SH "نام (NAME)"
neochat \- Client for interacting with the matrix messaging protocol
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.HP \w'\fBneochat\fR\ 'u
\fBneochat\fR [\fIURI\fR]
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.PP
\fBneochat\fR
is a chat application for the matrix protocol that work on both desktop and mobile\&.
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.PP
\fBURI\fR
.RS 4
The matrix uri for an user or a room\&. e\&.g matrix:u/user:example\&.org and matrix:r/root:example\&.org\&. This will makes NeoChat try to open the given room or conversation\&.
.RE
.SH "گزارش باگ‌ها (REPORTING BUGS)"
.PP
You can report bugs and feature requests at
\m[blue]\fBhttps://bugs\&.kde\&.org/enter_bug\&.cgi?product=NeoChat&component=General\fR\m[]
.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
.RS 4

      A list of frequently asked questions about Matrix \m[blue]\fBhttps://matrix\&.org/faq/\fR\m[]
    
.RE
.RS 4
kf5options(7)
.RE
.RS 4
